Hand-written SQL migrations for PostgreSQL. Run `uv run alembic heads` to see
the latest revision in this checkout.

Run `uv run alembic upgrade head` with the genuine schema owner PG__* settings.
Alembic/entrypoint does not consume MIGRATION_DATABASE_URL; that variable belongs
only to `make db-configure-roles`. Drain old analysis/benchmark workers first.

Revision 0022 adds private benchmark cases and preserves the receipt deletion
fence. Revision 0023 records paired benchmark runs. The respective downgrade
refuses to discard existing private cases or links between runs. Back up both
PostgreSQL and the configured image store, including benchmark_cases/ originals.

Read ../UPGRADE_AND_VERIFY.md for the upgrade sequence from 0010 or 0021,
role bootstrap/grants, runtime-credential startup and compatible recovery.
